---
layout: "layout"
title: "Lead Education Group | Pioneering Education"
background_color: "white"
header_color: "transparent"
---

<main role="main">

  <section class="lead-hero" aria-label="Lead Eduction Group Hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="lead-hero-inner">
        <div class="lead-hero-text">
          <p class="top-accent-text">Lead Education Group</p>
          <h1>Establishing international schools of distinction for future success.</h1>
          <p>The most reliable pathway to success, in an interconnected world, is an international education.</p>
          <!-- <p><a class="cta cta-primary cta-fit-width" href="#" role="button">Learn more</a></p> -->
        </div>
        <div class="lead-hero-image">
          <%= image_tag '04-copy.jpg', id: 'hero-image-1' %>
          <%= image_tag '05.jpg', id: 'hero-image-2' %>
          <%= image_tag '07.jpg', id: 'hero-image-3' %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-label="second" class="banner-section second">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 banner-d-flex">
          <div id="globe-image"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 banner-d-flex">
          <div class="inner-text">
            <p class="top-accent-text">The Challenge</p>
            <h3>Education for an interconnected world</h3>
            <p>The COVID 19 virus graphically demonstrated how interconnected everyone is on the planet. What happens in one country quickly affects those in other countries. Economic conditions in one part of the world influence prices elsewhere.</p>
            <p>In a world such as this, education geared to only one language and culture is greatly inadequate. Companies and universities seek people with a broad worldview that can best be fostered in an international school setting.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-label="third" class="banner-section svg-green-borders-section bg-light-green">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row direction-reverse-on-small">
        <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 banner-d-flex">
          <div class="inner-text" style="max-width: 420px;">
            <p class="top-accent-text">The Opportunity</p>
            <h3>Schools for future success</h3>
            <p>LEAD Education seeks to meet this challenge by starting multi-lingual, international schools in cities where such educational opportunities do not currently exist.</p><p>These “schools of distinction” prepare students for a bright future by offering them a truly international educational experience.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 banner-d-flex">
          <%= image_tag '01.jpg', class: 'section-image' %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>




  <section aria-label="fourth" class="banner-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12 banner-d-flex">
          <div class="inner-text center">
            <p class="top-accent-text">The Approach</p>
            <h3>Three central elements combine to form a “school of distinction.”</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-4">
          <div class="lead-column">
            <div class="header-icon" id="apple"></div>
            <div class="inner-text">
              <h4>Quality Educators</h4>
              <p>Educators are credentialed teachers who are prepared to teach at a given grade level, committed to each student’s learning and development and enthusiastic about teaching.</p>
              <p>Most teachers also spend one year studying the local language and culture before they enter the classroom.  This prepares them to live and teach cross-culturally and facilitates their interactions with parents.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-4">
          <div class="lead-column">
            <div class="header-icon" id="ribbon"></div>
            <div class="inner-text">
              <h4>Proven Curriculum</h4>
              <p>The Common Core Curriculum is used in 46 of the 50 states in America. This curriculum is a set of standards that students reach in creative ways.</p>
              <p>Rather than simply memorize facts, Common Core teaches students to analyze situations and solve problems thus preparing them for university studies and life itself.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-4">
          <div class="lead-column">
            <div class="header-icon" id="globe"></div>
            <div class="inner-text">
              <h4>Adaptation to Local Culture and Languages</h4>
              <p>Local cultures and languages are highly respected. Although education is international in scope and English serves as the primary language of instruction, much appreciation is given to the local milieu, languages, holidays and customs.</p>
              <p>Students learn to value their own cultural heritage as well as respect the cultural backgrounds of others.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-label="fifth" class="banner-section pt-6 bg-light-red">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center text-center">
        <p style="width: 320px;">Have an inquiry? Want to partner with us? Send us a message and let's explore how we can work together.</p>
        <p><a class="cta cta-primary cta-fit-width" href="contact.html" role="button">Contact Us</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>
